    body: "The author surveyed 1,273 U.S. workers in 2024 on employer monitoring and work assignment. More intensive productivity monitoring is tied to pace pressure, anxiety and injuries, even after adjustments. Monitoring workers say is used to discipline them is more strongly tied to pace pressure and injuries.",
